DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_1806_C4C5';
<p>1806_c4c5</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #775900;">Gene N</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #775900;"><i>nerdy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #775900;">Gene N</span> has large, prominent eyes that stand out, much like thick-rimmed glasses.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #006e59;">Gene P</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #006e59;"><i>prickly</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #006e59;">Gene P</span> is covered with sharp bristles, giving it a spiky texture.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #7441a6;">Gene T</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #7441a6;"><i>tipsy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #7441a6;">Gene T</span> moves in an erratic path, suggesting a lack of coordination, as if intoxicated.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">nerdy, prickly, tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">30,710</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">nerdy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">17,020</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">nerdy, tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">8,908</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">nerdy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">3,197</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly, tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">3,129</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">8,874</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">17,142</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">31,020</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">120,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>P</b> and <b>N</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>P</b> and <b>N</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_1806_C4C5
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(3,129 + 3,197 + 17,020 + 30,710)</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = <sup>54,056</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = 0.4505 = <strong>45.05 cM</strong>
LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(3,129 + 3,197 + 8,874 + 17,020)</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = <sup>32,220</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = 0.2685 = <strong>26.85 cM</strong>
LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(3,129 + 3,197 + 8,874 + 8,908)</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = <sup>24,108</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = 0.2009 = <strong>20.09 cM</strong>
LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(3,129 + 3,197 + 8,908 + 31,020)</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = <sup>46,254</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = 0.3855 = <strong>38.55 cM</strong>
LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(3,197 + 8,908 + 17,142 + 31,020)</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = <sup>60,267</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = 0.5022 = <strong>50.22 cM</strong>
LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(30,710 + 31,020)</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = <sup>61,730</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = 0.5144 = <strong>51.44 cM</strong>
LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(3,129 + 3,197 + 8,874 + 8,908)</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = <sup>24,108</sup>/<sub>120,000</sub> = 0.2009 = <strong>20.09 cM</strong>
LITERAL_1806_C4C5_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
